e of your crosshair image;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>POWER ICON</strong>: Toggle the visibility of your crosshair overlay, or,</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>TRIGGER</strong>: Assign a hotkey to show or hide your crosshair overlay;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>SETTINGS ICON</strong>: Read About the application, or Reset to defaults.</p></li></ul>","developers":["The Open Gamer"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Utilities","id":"57"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3830340/5009dbcf238e6f65716bb4edeb61f8de3f826e40/header.jpg?t=1753596674","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3830340/1202459202/947bb5cd7298ad26fb1edfd22474c0c1db3fec13/1750385046/dash_av1.mpd?t=1751352297","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3830340/1202459202/947bb5cd7298ad26fb1edfd22474c0c1db3fec13/1750385046/dash_h264.mpd?t=1751352297","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3830340/1202459202/947bb5cd7298ad26fb1edfd22474c0c1db3fec13/1750385046/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1751352297","id":257159041,"name":"My Crosshair","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257159041/0ad2f10ee2374aa44361b740e54ab92b0787b2d9/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1751352297"}],"name":"My Crosshair","package_groups":[{"description":"","display_type":0,"is_recurring_subscription":"false","name":"default","save_text":"","selection_text":"Select a purchase option","subs":[{"can_get_free_license":"0","is_free_license":false,"option